in":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Very specific case, but it took some time to figure out why the built-in tests were failing for me.\n\nWith $enablePrettyUrl = true, this does not work:\n\n`http://localhost/yii2-app-basic/web/index.php`\n\nBut this does:\n\n`http://localhost/yii2-app-basic/web/index.php/` (notice slash at end)\n\nThe former gives error _Unable to resolve the request \"\"._\n\nIn `yii\\web\\UrlManager::parseRequest($request)`, the difference seems to be this:\n\n``` php\nif ($this->enablePrettyUrl) {\n    // line 217\n    return [$pathInfo, []]; // $pathinfo = false\n}\nelse {\n    // line 224\n    return [(string)$route, []]; // $route = null, typecasted to string \"\"\n}\n```\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/1991/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/1991/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":86957402,"node_id":"MDEzOkFzc2lnbmVkRXZlbnQ4Njk1NzQwMg==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/events/86957402","actor":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url